013:     - Each sprite has an anchor pixel — its least-frequent color. Markers share these colors.
014: 
015:     Rule:
016:     - Match each destination marker to the source sprite with the same anchor color.
017:     - Translate the sprite so its anchor overlaps the marker position.
018:     - Output is the destination rectangle, interior cleared before stamping.
019: 
020:     Key insight: The rarest color per sprite doubles as a template key and positioning anchor.
021:     """
